{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_vodfox_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_vodfox_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"无字诅咒","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_vodfox_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"2f61006441d5a688688cb319101bb9c2ed4245f3fceaf00270d473b549d3dd7c","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g5_srcpark"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫恋，接下来其他人要在病房里诊断和救治那些感染者，你自己待在这里，可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，不对，我说错了......还有小莫提陪着你，你们一起待在这里，应该没问题吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。你们去解决那些人的问题吧，这里可以交给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的意思不是要交给你什么任务呀......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（算了，和罗德岛上的许多孩子比起来，巫恋其实还挺成熟的，相信她好了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，那我去忙了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小莫提，你听到声音了，对吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小莫提","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。我知道，你不会错过哭声的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毛罗先生，请不要这样，这会让我很难办的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为感染者，你缴纳的保险金不足规定金额的百分之五十，是不能继续工作的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可、可是，我明明已经交过足额的保险金了......昨天，昨天晚上您的下属上门来收的呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的下属？我没有安排他们这么做，更没有见到你声称交来的那笔钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，法典此处已经写明，保险金由法官收缴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你必须确保钱交到我这里，否则，我该如何更新记录？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，根据记录，你目前就是拖欠保险金的状态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可他们......他们上一次来的时候，说的是“法官怎么可能亲自为讨债而奔波”......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看着我手中的法典，再仔细回忆一下。你敢确定自己的记忆没出错吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊、啊......抱歉，是我记错了，法官。一切全是我自己的愚蠢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我真的交不出一分钱了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？真遗憾。你的身体状况也无法胜任我们提供的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因此，根据律法，我只能从你的家产中没收一部分，作为抵押。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我为了凑够那笔钱，家里已经没有东西可以给您没收了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？我认为我的眼睛比你更清楚事物的价值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我们一家人也不能没有饭吃啊......求求您，再宽限一点时间吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一定能想办法搞到些钱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望你尊重法典，可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是，当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正巧，我眼前就有一件还算有价值的东西，法典允许你以此抵押。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......您是说这只怀表？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，您说得对！是我忘记了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想起来就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，我们可以约定在这只怀表的时针走字两圈之后再见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，谢谢您的宽容......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个，按照律法，抵押的东西，我还能赎回来吗？那、那是我曾祖父在家族内战里的遗物......能让我获得一些尊重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小莫提，我们要对那个人说吗？......嗯，不说出来比较好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的身边，已经跟着很多诅咒了。这样下去，会发生坏事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？疯疯癫癫的小女孩，一个人乱跑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是在找自己的家人吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后巷的垃圾桶，河底，墓地或花园......多半是在这些地方吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小莫提，觉得疼吗？......在下雨，但不是因为下雨才疼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也会疼得受不了的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那个女孩，刚刚是不是说了什么？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......该死，这场雨害得我又犯头疼了，不想了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信使刚刚来过一趟，这些都是寄给您的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有从沃尔西尼寄来的明信片吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我绝不敢擅自查看您的信件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但您做了这么多事，一定会获得家主的称赞......我大胆猜测，明信片应该也到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，先看看其他的吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"造纸厂的老板送来的礼物，东街二十家住户的赔偿金，还不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"镇议事会的邀请函？这种东西，没有必要寄给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这封信是为自己入狱的儿子求情......无聊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反面还有字？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你过来。把这件事办了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您的意思是把这个罪犯放出去？他家里还没给够钱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要你看的是反面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反面只有白纸啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，我明白。寄信人会被干净利落地处理掉，不留任何痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然用诅咒来发泄怨恨的方式很可笑，但我也不希望看到有人不尊重我的法典。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诅咒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，再看看下一封。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——怎么回事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，先回来。手里的信给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一模一样的内容和字迹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每一封信，每一封信都有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“你的恶意招来了诅咒，你的身上会发生很坏的事情。黑色羽兽纠缠着你，你会失去身上唯一闪闪发光的东西。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真幼稚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我搞清楚，这么幼稚的事情是谁做出来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我确实只看见白纸......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我是说，我们一定会把恶作剧的人揪出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天的那些诅咒信，居然到现在都没查出任何结果。这座小镇不就只有这么些人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我身边是不是该换几个更得力的助手了呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......从那个感染者手里拿来的怀表，走字比标准时间慢了五分钟啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不得不说，我确实一向很宽容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望他不要辜负我的善意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，您还记得自己是什么时候出现矿石病症状的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......我不确定。也许是近几天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您对自己感染矿石病的原因，有没有什么头绪呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，根据我们对您做的临时检测来看，您和这附近的许多人一样，是最近刚刚遭受急性感染。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们需要查清大规模感染的源头，尽量遏制住矿石病在这座小镇蔓延。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，您说的这些，我不太听得懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我以前就在那边餐厅的后厨工作，没别的，别的我什么都不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，那打扰了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫恋，你那边有没有感觉到什么异常？比如像以前一样，被活性源石影响，源石技艺失控之类的感觉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫恋？你在看什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......黑色的羽兽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们是什么人？在这里做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，您好。我们是一家医疗机构，正在与镇医院合作，提供一些技术支持。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说，你们是从哥伦比亚来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这倒不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，我想和这位先生沟通一下，希望你们让道——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呸！羽兽？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滚开！滚开！别啄我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，她的怀表掉到地上了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你扯我袖子干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等在这里，不要动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳......总算飞走了，嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，黑色的羽兽......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵，怎么可能有人敢诅咒我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尊敬的法官，我......呃，我能帮您点什么？您要不要进屋来整理一下衣服......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我只希望秉公办事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，对对，您是为了保险金而来的......给。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"数额不对。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......可是您还没有数过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厚度至少应该是这个信封的三倍。我想，你或许是把滞纳保险金的罚款数目记错了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，法典对此有所规定，我必须依照律法行事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那一定是我记错了，我再想办法去别处借钱，请再给我一点时间吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，我一向很宽容。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那只破破烂烂的金怀表，掉到哪里去了？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（诅咒......碰巧应验了而已。怎么可能有人相信诅咒？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就这样吧，两天后我们再见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真倒霉，真倒霉！事到如今，没别的办法了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这该死的不长眼睛的羽兽！都是你们害的！要不是她心情不好，我这事今天就该摆平了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小莫提，帮我把地上的怀表捡起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小莫提","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，没有摔坏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给，你的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（果然，巫恋用了她的源石技艺。所以我们都能看见那只怀表掉在了地上，但是那名法官看不见。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小巫恋居然已经成熟到会这样为他人着想了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不知道她有没有意识到，自己在做一件非常勇敢的事情呢？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......唉，可是就算她在罗德岛已经接受了很多源石技艺的相关训练，施展这种法术还是会对她的身体造成负荷的啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（总之，虽然她做得没错，但我得对她的状况多加关注......有可能的话，也帮她一把吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它对你来说，代表着“家族”。“一个很大的家庭”，那是很重要的东西吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿回它，不好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在说什么呢，这、这不是我的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我根本没见过它。你爱把它拿到哪里去就拿到哪里去吧，我反正没见过！今天更是没见过！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小莫提，你今天很有精神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你吃下的是什么？悲伤，恐惧还是怨恨？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小莫提","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么会恐惧？我也想知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你拿了那只怀表，就快点走开。我要把门关上了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还想知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个人手里的书，明明一个字都没有写。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么不告诉她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那明明是法典，怎么会没有字？你自己不识字而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，那边的医生，你不是个成年人吗？快把你身边的疯小孩带走啊！离我和我的房子远一点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，巫恋。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天本地依然风平浪静，没有需要审理的案件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"街道上发生的都是些小事。有人在一家餐厅吃饭时遇到了抢劫犯，据说是最近滞纳保险金的感染者之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这能保证我们按时收到钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，还有......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像有很多人在背后议论您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——议论什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一些滑稽可笑的“预言”，据说是胡乱写在小巷海报上的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我派人去找了，没有找到，应该已经被撕掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，是哪些人还没学会如何尊重律法的意志呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是哪些人第一次开口提起这些胡言乱语，不是为了向我报告？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关于这件事......实际上，好像没有人真的说起过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有人说起，那他们要怎么议论？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一如既往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们保持沉默，但是心中了然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您看到他们的眼神在回避什么，就知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g10_smallrestaurant"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在想什么呢，刚刚我和小巫恋坐在这里吃饭，看到你走过来，还拍了拍你两个孩子的脑袋......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为你是进来给他们点两份儿童餐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结果你居然说要抢劫？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是我们的做事方式，外地人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别挣扎了，我和巫恋不会让你惹事的。这是我们的做事方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......昨天你们不是在场吗？你们不是看到我拖欠了多少保险金吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们既然说不想让感染者死，那就别拦着我啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许我不太懂这里的状况，但我敢肯定，你做了这样的坏事，迟早会被其他人报复的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，你的两个孩子还在街道上和其他孩子一起玩。如果你现在让这里的一位顾客流了血，接下来他们身上会发生什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我只是在问你，我该怎么办。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果明天他们就会把我们一家人从房子里赶出去，我怎么去想之后的事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不会的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小莫提会帮忙的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帮我再找一些东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的土，里面灌满了怨恨和恐惧，别的材料，只需要一点点就够了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，没事，我去帮她......也是为了帮你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帮我？你们能有什么手段？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有时候，一个人被周围的恶意折磨得无处可去了，就只好去相信一些最不可思议的东西，甚至是幻觉。不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别像上一次一样给我添麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......对了，毛罗先生，我们想跟你约定一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果明天那名自称法官的女士没有来向你讨债，我们想请你多说一说这里出现大量感染者的事情，可以吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“你的恶行招来了诅咒。”......和上次一样的说辞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，无稽之谈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，怎么会有人把那种恶作剧当真呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还在搜寻那个可笑的始作俑者。不过......呃，困难之处在于，我们都没有亲眼见到那些诅咒的文字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我们收集到了文字的具体内容，但似乎没有人知道是谁留下的——至少没有人愿意告诉我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她意识到街道上的行人都在回避她的视线，从她身边走过时却又好像带着一丝好奇与打探。\n沉默是一种秩序，但此刻的沉默让她感到恐惧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天这个感染者，我已经不想在他身上浪费太多时间了。如果他拿不出钱，就直接没收他的房子吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最后出面一次——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"跌倒在地的瞬间，法官的脑子里回响起她听人转述的诅咒。\n接着传来的是小腿处的剧痛，还有路边的窃窃私语。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您、您还好吗？我扶您起来，这里有很多人在看，有损您的形象......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"滚开！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"该死......你是瞎了吗！我摔伤了，送我去医院！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么感染者那边我通知其他人去处理？反正只是件小事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样下去，诅咒是不是会无穷无尽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......诅咒怎么可能是真的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看不到吗？诅咒就是真的......它追上我了！恶灵追上我了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请您冷静，大家都在往这边看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇法官","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之......那个感染者的事，先放在一边吧。我需要冷静一段时间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g8_srcroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遵照约定，我把我知道的事情告诉你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，你们是白费力气。这里根本没有你们想象的那种地下源石矿，或者恐怖的大工厂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是之前，这里有一场持续了将近一个月的帮派斗殴，我们这些路过的人偶然被卷了进去，仅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，之前听到过，这里有大量走私源石的事件......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果那些源石是被帮派成员用来制造爆炸物，制造工艺又不够规范的话，确实很容易导致活性源石粉尘逸散。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者没有第一时间发现自己的身体问题，或者隐瞒病情，也很常见，因此造成了病人最近还在陆续出现的假象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有人会蠢到告诉医生，自己是被卷入帮派斗殴而感染的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都会假装什么也没看到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，面对这样的大规模械斗，难道就没有法官来制止？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法官？哈哈，那些大城市的情况我不清楚，但这样的小镇里，哪里有法官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斗殴的帮派背后有家族支持，他们一直打到一方完全将另一方驱逐出去，控制整个镇子，才算结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你们遇到的那个“法官”，只是获胜家族用来控制这座小镇的一名普通家族成员罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......抱歉，我问了无关矿石病的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢你协助我们完成了任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，是我该感谢你们，即使只是让我的厄运晚来了一天......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毛罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，跟着你的这个小女孩，似乎不接受我的感谢啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的，她只是在盯着别的东西......但她一定听到了你在说什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，你回去之后，记得吃这些药控制病情。保重。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫恋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过，小莫提会帮助他。你当时不相信我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，当然不是啦。其实，是你影响的人已经太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下一次用源石技艺，一定要跟其他人商量好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这么做，万一失控，会对其他人伤害很大......也可能对你自己伤害很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的话，罗德岛已经对我说了很多次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小莫提不会受伤的话，就没关系......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直说，小莫提很有精神，小莫提没有受伤，所以没关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但其实，你已经很疲劳了。我不能让你的疲劳积累到会损害身体的程度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这里我不会再用法术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有......再给我一个苹果。不是施术材料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想多吃点东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们确认了这里感染的源头，为剩下的感染者做完应急处理后，也该回本舰了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g1_srcstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仪器都打包好了吗？没有问题的话，我们就准备撤离了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇“法官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，大家先将推车都靠边，让腿脚不便的病人先过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇“法官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们的调查结束了吗？我听闻贵公司在调查那些感染者的病因，看来你们已经得到结果了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟我们出差一趟也是有时间限制的，在这段时间里我们受限于能力水平，并没有发现什么统一的病因，实在抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小莫提。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帮我把她手里的书拿过来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（很多人会在遇见与过去相似的环境时，被触动心中的伤痛......不过，对巫恋来说，或许这种事从一开始就不是问题吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（虽然很古怪，不过她的确在用自己的方式成长。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——咳，小巫恋，我要夸奖你了，你要做好心理准备哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会使用法术，应该是因为你——啊不，因为小莫提在那座小镇里感受到了和过去相似的痛苦吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人们都以敌意互相对待，互相宣泄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明有很多人知道，你不是诅咒的源头，你是无辜的......却没有一个人愿意大声说出这些话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"于是在这座小镇里，你用自己的法术，帮那个感染者、还有其他人说出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“那是一本无字的法典”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经成熟得让我有些惊讶啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你，很奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么复杂的想法，小莫提不需要，我也不需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫恋","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小莫提想要那个法官的情感作为食粮，我让它吃饱了，这样不够吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。原来你没有想那么多吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我自己做了好久的判断，才默许你动用源石技艺......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，只是觉得对方欺负人，所以要施以惩罚......这个简单的理由，也不算坏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——哎，等等，我怎么会突然这么想，突然觉得不教育你也没关系......该不会是中了你的精神暗示吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_254_vodfox_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你别突然露出笑容啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“法官”下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拐杖放在这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇“法官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我休息一会儿，有什么事我会找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“法官”下属","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇“法官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......这两天没有再听说什么诅咒，噩梦应该也到头了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇“法官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"周日早晨，没有下雨的街道，总觉得空气都比平时更加清新。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小镇“法官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那本被她随手放在桌上的法典，被一阵风吹到了新的一页。\n哗啦，哗啦。\n她在书页上看见了一行字。和此前诅咒的笔迹相同的一行字。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
